{"channelId":"UC0F_evdwWkwSNZhamwnHgNw","row":["Jodi Scholes",9600,"I teach a Massage & Bodywork Licensing Exam Review Course. #mblex I love to support graduates of massage school in passing this 'challenging' test.\n\nEach week you can watch a shorter version of the recorded classes here, for free. I recommend you SUBSCRIBE. \nIf this style of teaching works for you, attend and participate in live class when you join the Patreon community. https://www.patreon.com/jodischoles\nDonations gratefully accepted via Venmo, @jodi-scholes\n\nOur curriculum is based on the 7 categories you will be tested on for the MBLEx. We teach 44 lessons per year. \n\nAbout me: I am former Adjunct Faculty in the Allied Health/Massage Therapy program at Northern VA Community College. I am a Licensed Massage Therapist in 3 states and graduated in 1994. I have performed over 20,000 clients sessions. I am the author of the book, Body Blueprint - How Your Pain May Be Telling a Story. Available on Amazon. https://www.amazon.com/Body-Blueprint-Your-Telling-Story/dp/B0CS33ZBQV","jodi@jodischoles.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0F_evdwWkwSNZhamwnHgNw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0F_evdwWkwSNZhamwnHgNw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:09.998Z","channelId":"UC0F_evdwWkwSNZhamwnHgNw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"79d0d5b6036921e633809dbe81a7578fca5d5f4ba712f659ae28f62277ccb052","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"f9efb66e053b50fb990592cc29cac99e958847bd8624c2ed2348f380b4fbbbba"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0F_evdwWkwSNZhamwnHgNw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:55:50.383Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0F_evdwWkwSNZhamwnHgNw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":9600,"raw":"9.6K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0F_evdwWkwSNZhamwnHgNw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12: